<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38089" root="لوث" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لوثَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Languor, and slowness,</i> or <i>tardiness.</i>
(S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ ذُو لُوثَةٍ</span> <i>A man slow,</i> or <i>tardy,
and weak.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُوثَةٌ</span> <i>Weakness:</i> (IAar,
K:) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَوْثٌ</span></b> . (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <i>Weakness of judgment, and a repetition,</i> or <i>stuttering,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَلَجْلُجٌ</span>,)
<i>in speech.</i> (TA, from a trad.) <i>An impediment
in speech.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُونَةٌ</span> (IAar, M, K) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَوْثَةٌ</span></b>  (IAar, M) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَوْثٌ</span></b>  (Msb) <i>Stupidity;
foolishness; paucity of sense.</i> (IAar, M, K, Msb.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُوثَةٌ</span> <i>A touch,</i> or <i>first affection, of insanity,</i>
or <i>diabolical possession.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b7-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُوثَةٌ</span> <i>A
state of excitement;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَيْجٌ</span>. (S, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُوثَةٌ</span> <i>Abundance of flesh and fat,</i> (S, K,) in a
she-camel. (S.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَوْثٌ</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُوثَةٌ</span> <i>A piece
of rag collected together, with which one plays.</i>
(K.)

